00:58:28.130 --> 00:58:33.760
<v Ann Beeson>We're the ACLU and we know you're one of these FISA judges, and we want to file a brief. What do we do?
<v Ann Beeson>我们是ACLU，我们知道你是这些FISA法官之一，我们要提交一份简报。我们该怎么做？

00:58:33.760 --> 00:58:55.450
